  "title": "ieee1905: Update Profile-2 AP Capability TLV",
  "description": "update r2_ap_capa_flags (epan/dissectors/packet-ieee1905.c):\n- rename\n  - hf_ieee1905_basic_service_prio_flag ==> hf_ieee1905_ctag_service_prio_flag\n  - hf_ieee1905_enhanced_service_prio_flag ==> hf_ieee1905_dpp_onboarding_flag\n- add new flag hf_ieee1905_traffic_separation_flag:0x08 used by r2_ap_capa_flags\n- update hf_ieee1905_r2_ap_capa_flags_reserved:0x07\n\nas defined by https://www.wi-fi.org/downloads-registered-guest/Wi-Fi_EasyMesh_Specification_v5.0.pdf : 17.2.48 Profile-2 AP Capability TLV format / Table 65. Profile-2 AP Capability TLV format\n![image](/uploads/75e7c7f43dac1c4ba282591e9427ea80/image.png)\n[AP_autoconfiguration_WSC_M1_TS.pcap.pcapng](/uploads/d35700a27bfb597f4ff094fd9b356926/AP_autoconfiguration_WSC_M1_TS.pcap.pcapng)\n![image](/uploads/5d03c0aaf2a9f03b64a88610b4af9ad7/image.png)",
